--
Regression for the full SSSJ verification shape: ArrayList +
iterator + sealed-pattern-match dispatch + reduce. Exercises:
  - Sealed field allocation (nondet-switch over permits)
  - get_class_identifier_field (interface instanceof via Object*)
  - F9 CHECKCAST refinement guard (erased @class_identifier only)
  - CProverArrayLikeIterator deterministic iteration
  - Sealed-pattern-match (typeSwitch) on nested sealed types

Pre-fix: MatchException thrown because F9 CHECKCAST refinement
overwrote the concrete @class_identifier of objects returned by
the iterator model. Post-fix: refinement is guarded on the
erased default, preserving concrete tags.
